      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive veterinarians and warm clinical staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend Dr. Trice, Dr. Remnes, and the veterinary technicians for exceptional warmth, deep knowledge, and thorough examinations. Clients emphasize that the doctors never rush appointments, taking time to answer every question and offering thoughtful follow-up calls after visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 26,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for anxious companion animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently highlight the staff's gentle approach toward nervous dogs and timid cats. Many clients note their pets stay remarkably relaxed during exams and vaccinations. Owners of felines particularly appreciate dedicated cat condos, toys, and treats provided in exam rooms to reduce stress."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Boutique clinic aesthetic with spotless facilities"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently describe the practice as an upscale, beautifully appointed veterinary space with immaculate examination suites. Reviewers appreciate thoughtful amenities, including complimentary refreshments for owners and calming private exam rooms designed to make clinical visits feel comfortable."
      }
    }
  ],
